ou, you knew, you knew. And I thought that I saw, but all I seen was imaginary. My imagination, it's taking me to places I reach. Sometimes I close my eyes, and I hope it's not true. I look at you like you knew. I look at you like you should have protected me. But I should have protected you. My heart's here for you always, always. And I thought I did it. I don't know what to do to get back to where you thought I was. They put me up on that fucking pedestal. Why are you so cold? I thought you knew. I needed you to know. I believed in you. Now I call you on the phone. I don't know what I'm doing. I'm just so angry. Sometimes I look at you minute by minute, call by call. I don't know for the first time. Maybe the second time. I don't really fucking know. All I really fucking know is that I love you. I miss you. I miss you. And I wish I could scratch you out of my mind. But you're there, you're there, you're there. Every time I close my eyes, you're there, you're there, you're there. And I wipe the tears from my eyes. I think about you all the time. I need you to be part of my life. The one that doesn't bring me down, the one that flips me up, I swear we can do it. You're my inspiration.","lyricsSegments":[{"end":18.739999771118164,"text":"I used to be able to see all that was ahead of me.","start":8.239999771118164},{"end":23.600000381469727,"text":"I used to look at you like maybe you knew.","start":20.479999542236328},{"end":28.280000686645508,"text":"You told me, baby, you had the answers to it all.","start":24},{"end":37.13999938964844,"text":"You told me that you, you knew, you knew.","start":29.280000686645508},{"end":44.540000915527344,"text":"And I thought that I saw, but all I seen was imaginary.","start":37.7400016784668},{"end":59.86000061035156,"text":"My imagination, it's taking me to places I reach.","start":46.58000183105469},{"end":68.69999694824219,"text":"Sometimes I close my eyes, and I hope it's not true.","start":61.099998474121094},{"end":73.7399